 "checked": "Inter treble 2009-10, first by an Italian club; Coppa Italia final 5 May, Serie A won 16 May, CL final 22 May at the Bernabeu, Bayern 0-2 Inter, Milito both, the first from Sneijder's pass (Eurosport, Inter.it, 90min, Planet Football). WC QF 2 July 2010 Port Elizabeth: Robinho 10', Brazil 1-0 at half-time, Sneijder two (the first via Melo, credited to Sneijder), the winner a header from Robben's in-swinging corner flicked on by Kuyt, 68' (Al Jazeera, FIFA, 11v11). Goal v Uruguay in the semi, 5 goals, joint top with Muller, Villa, Forlan; Forlan Golden Ball, Sneijder second (Goal, SBS, SA News). Final lost 1-0 to Spain, Iniesta 116' (FourFourTwo, UEFA). FIFA Ballon d'Or 2010: Messi 22.65, Iniesta 17.36, Xavi 16.48, Sneijder 4th 14.48 (Wikipedia, Topend). Messi no WC goals, Argentina lost 4-0 to Germany (Wikipedia 2010 Ballon d'Or context, 90min). Header recreated with gamecap (specs/sneijder-2010.json); Kuyt's flick cannot be drawn, so the header is direct.",
